Subject: [PATCH 3/7] vk_graphics_pipeline: claim a held draw's worker-only
 build

Port of Lichii PR 321 by Joey-Magnus. A draw that reaches an unbuilt
pipeline runs that pipeline's build itself again, also when its SPIR-V
emission was deferred to the workers. Waiting instead left the draw
behind every pipeline queued on the FIFO workers before it. On entering
an area in Ocarina of Time, 332 pipelines were built in 20 s and draws
were held for 16 s of it. PipelineBuild::State claims a build
atomically, so the worker and the GPU thread never both run it.

