From d3c0ff7b675921cbcc9fbc73d0382d46fc0eacbd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nau Fantom <353563530+nauxph@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 18:24:24 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] vulkan: skip draws of heavy unbuilt pipelines
 (EDEN_NX2_HEAVY_SKIP)

Port of the heavy skip commit of Lichii PR 579 by PantACRO4life
(faaf301cca), without the rest of that draft PR.

While the driver builds a native pipeline of at least N converted
instructions, its draws are skipped instead of holding every draw behind
it. A heavy draw is still held when skipping it could lose data for good:
the pipeline writes storage or uses transform feedback, its render target
was not cleared this frame, or it is a new small target.

The held-draw wait keeps the build claim from Lichii PR 321 for every
build (the original claimed only with the skip on).

